/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin:/usr/games:/usr/local/games:/snap/bin\nVIRTUAL_ENV : /home/admin2/.sglang\n\n==== GPU Topology ====\nnvidia-smi topo -m:\nGPU0    GPU1    GPU2    GPU3    CPU Affinity    NUMA Affinity   GPU NUMA ID\nGPU0     X      NODE    NODE    NODE    0-63    0               N/A\nGPU1    NODE     X      NODE    NODE    0-63    0               N/A\nGPU2    NODE    NODE     X      NODE    0-63    0               N/A\nGPU3    NODE    NODE    NODE     X      0-63    0               N/A\n```\n\n### Bug description\n\nHello,\n\nI was running zai-org/GLM-5.3-Flash via vllm and sglang using the provided commands on a machine with four Blackwell 6000 Pro GPUs(sm_120), but I encountered the issues below.\n\n### Minimal reproduction\n\n```python\nsglang serve \\\n  --model-path zai-org/GLM-5.3-Flash \\\n  --tp-size 4 \\\n  --dsa-prefill-backend trtllm \\\n  --dsa-decode-backend trtllm \\\n  --kv-cache-dtype fp8_e4m3 \\\n  --moe-runner-backend flashinfer_trtllm \\\n  --mamba-ssm-dtype bfloat16 \\\n  --mamba-full-memory-ratio 0.90 \\\n  --disable-flashinfer-autotune \\\n  --disable-custom-all-reduce \\\n  --disable-decode-cuda-graph \\\n  --mem-fraction-static 0.85 \\\n  --max-running-requests 24 \\\n  --reasoning-parser glm45 \\\n  --tool-call-parser glm47 \\\n  --host 0.0.0.0 \\\n  --port 30000\n```\n\n### Error messages / logs\n\n```text\n[transformers] The following generation flags are not valid and may be ignored: ['top_p']. Set `TRANSFORMERS_VERBOSITY=info` for more details.\n[2026-09-22 17:27:12] Breakable CUDA graph is incompatible with KDA hybrid linear attention; disabling prefill CUDA graph.\n[2026-09-22 17:27:12] Use dsa attention backend for DeepSeek with DSA.\n[2026-09-22 17:27:12] Setting page size to 64 for DeepSeek DSA.\n[2026-09-22 17:27:12] Set dense attention kv len threshold to model index_topk=2048 for DeepSeek with DSA.\n[2026-09-22 17:27:12] DSA with TP mode is active, dp_size=1, tp_size=4, attn_tp_size=4, attention weights will be sharded across 4 ranks.\n[2026-09-22 17:27:12] Set DSA backends for fp8_e4m3 KV Cache: prefill=trtllm, decode=trtllm.\n[2026-09-22 17:27:12] FlashInfer TRTLLM MoE is enabled. --disable-shared-experts-fusion is automatically set.\n[2026-09-22 17:27:13] Compiled-kernel caches now live under SGLANG_CACHE_DIR (/home/admin2/.cache/sglang). These older directories are no longer used by sglang, but may still be used by other frameworks on this machine, so they were left alone: /home/admin2/.triton, /home/admin2/.cache/flashinfer. Remove them yourself if nothing else needs them.\n[2026-09-22 17:27:13] server_args={'model_path': 'zai-org/GLM-5.3-Flash', 'tokenizer_path': 'zai-org/GLM-5.3-Flash', 'tokenizer_mode': 'auto', 'tokenizer_backend': 'huggingface', 'tokenizer_worker_num': 1, 'detokenizer_worker_num': 1, 'skip_tokenizer_init': False, 'load_format': 'auto', 'model_loader_extra_config': '{}', 'trust_remote_code': False, 'context_length': None, 'is_embedding': False, 'enable_multimodal': None, 'revision': None, 'model_impl': 'auto', 'model_config_parser': 'auto', 'json_model_override_args': '{}', 'dtype': 'auto', 'quantization': None, 'quantization_param_path': None, 'kv_cache_dtype': 'fp8_e4m3', 'enable_fp32_lm_head': False, 'modelopt_quant': None, 'modelopt_checkpoint_restore_path': None, 'modelopt_checkpoint_save_path': None, 'modelopt_export_path': None, 'quantize_and_serve': False, 'rl_quant_profile': None, 'enable_tf32_matmul': False, 'mem_fraction_static': 0.85, 'max_running_requests': 24, 'max_queued_requests': None, 'max_total_tokens': None, 'chunked_prefill_size': 8192, 'prefill_decode_interval': 0, 'enable_dynamic_chunking': False, 'max_prefill_tokens': 16384, 'prefill_max_requests': None, 'schedule_policy': 'fcfs', 'enable_priority_scheduling': False, 'disable_priority_preemption': False, 'default_priority_value': None, 'abort_on_priority_when_disabled': False, 'schedule_low_priority_values_first': False, 'priority_scheduling_preemption_threshold': 